-000149":{"c":"AKAM","form":"10-Q","filed":"2025-05-09"},"0001086222-25-000218":{"c":"AKAM","form":"10-Q","filed":"2025-08-08"},"0001086222-25-000256":{"c":"AKAM","form":"10-Q","filed":"2025-11-07"},"0001086222-26-000058":{"c":"AKAM","form":"10-Q","filed":"2026-05-08"},"0001086222-26-000086":{"c":"AKAM","form":"10-Q","filed":"2026-08-07"},"0001086222-26-000100":{"c":"AKAM","form":"10-Q","filed":"2026-11-06"}},"finsights":{"AKAM":[{"topic":"fcf","text":"Free cash flow was $1 billion in FY2025: operating cash flow of $1.5 billion less capital spending of $508 million (computed from two filed figures). That is 24% of revenue. In FY2020 it was $701 million.","cites":["AKAM.ocf.2025","AKAM.capex.2025","AKAM.revenue.2025","AKAM.ocf.2020","AKAM.capex.2020"]},{"topic":"sbc","text":"Stock-based compensation was $459 million in FY2025, 10.9% of revenue, against 6.2% in FY2020.","cites":["AKAM.sbc.2025","AKAM.revenue.2025","AKAM.sbc.2020","AKAM.revenue.2020"]},{"topic":"returns","text":"In FY2025 the company paid $800 million to repurchase its own shares. No dividend payment is tagged for the year.","cites":["AKAM.buybacks.2025"]},{"topic":"quarter","text":"In the three months ended 2026-09-30 revenue was $1.1 billion, up 6.4% from $1.1 billion in the three months ended 2025-09-30.","cites":["AKAM.d.revenue.2026-07-01.2026-09-30","AKAM.d.revenue.2025-07-01.2025-09-30"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Over the four quarters to 2026-09-30 revenue added up to $4.4 billion (computed from five filed figures), operating income to $398 million and net income to $388 million.","cites":["AKAM.d.revenue.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","AKAM.d.revenue.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","AKAM.d.revenue.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","AKAM.d.revenue.2026-04-01.2026-06-30","AKAM.d.revenue.2026-07-01.2026-09-30","AKAM.d.opinc.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","AKAM.d.opinc.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","AKAM.d.opinc.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","AKAM.d.opinc.2026-04-01.2026-06-30","AKAM.d.opinc.2026-07-01.2026-09-30","AKAM.d.netinc.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","AKAM.d.netinc.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","AKAM.d.netinc.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","AKAM.d.netinc.2026-04-01.2026-06-30","AKAM.d.netinc.2026-07-01.2026-09-30"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $545 million: operating cash flow of $1.4 billion less capital spending of $893 million (computed from ten filed figures).","cites":["AKAM.d.ocf.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","AKAM.d.ocf.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","AKAM.d.ocf.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","AKAM.d.ocf.2026-01-01.2026-06-30","AKAM.d.ocf.2026-01-01.2026-09-30","AKAM.d.capex.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","AKAM.d.capex.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","AKAM.d.capex.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","AKAM.d.capex.2026-01-01.2026-06-30","AKAM.d.capex.2026-01-01.2026-09-30"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Remaining performance obligations - revenue under contract that was not yet recognised - were $5.2 billion at the end of FY2025, against $4.3 billion a year earlier. That is 123.6% of FY2025 revenue (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["AKAM.rpo.2025","AKAM.rpo.2024","AKAM.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $151 million at the end of FY2025 (tagged ContractWithCustomerLiabilityCurrent), against $149 million a year earlier.","cites":["AKAM.deferred.2025","AKAM.deferred.2024"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 11,000 in its own words. FY2025 revenue works out to about $383,000 for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["AKAM.q.employees","AKAM.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"flags","text":"The FY2025 annual report tags restructuring charges of $58.1 million, after $95.4 million in FY2024.","cites":["AKAM.restructuring.2025","AKAM.restructuring.2024"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2025 the balance sheet carried $930 million in cash and cash equivalents and $256 million in short-term investments, and $4.1 billion of debt as tagged (ConvertibleLongTermNotesPayable + ConvertibleNotesPayableCurrent). Debt less cash and short-term investments was $2.9 billion (computed from four filed figures).","cites":["AKAM.cash.2025","AKAM.sti.2025","AKAM.debtLong.2025","AKAM.debtCurrent.2025"]}]},"fin":{"AKAM":{}},"quotes":{"AKAM.q.employees":{"c":"AKAM","kind":"employees","n":11000,"quote":"As of December 31, 2025, we had over 11,000 employees located in more than 30 countries (with approximately 65% of those employees located outside of the U.S.) and representing over 100 nationalities, all of which we believe helps bring a global perspective to our operations.","source":"AKAM-0001086222-26-000022","section":"Item 1. Business","date":"2026-02-20","proof":"229c910d3f0a6fc648d1c91d4c657242872cdfe1cad0205af54ba18ef7019fbb"}}}